Running the Chat System:
Start the chat server by running chat_server.py.
2. Start one or more chat clients by running chat_client.py in separate terminal windows.
Clients can send messages, and all connected clients will receive them in real-time.
This basic chat system can be further enhanced with features like user authentication, message history, and private messaging. If you need additional features or modifications, feel free to ask!

ToDO:

